            View Official Record on NASA NLSP &rarr;
          </a>
        </div>

        <h2>Summary / Description</h2>
        <div class="description">
          <p><span>The 48/49 crewmembers launched on July 6, 2016, and docked on July 9, 2016. They are scheduled to return in October 2016, on Soyuz S MS-01.  The crewmembers are:&nbsp;</span></p><ul><li><span>
Commander Anatoli Ivanishin, RSA </span></li><li><span>Flight Engineer 1 Kathleen Rubins, NASA </span></li><li><span>Flight Engineer 2 Takuya Onishi, JAXA </span></li></ul><p><span>
</span><span>The 49/50 crewmembers will launch on September 23, 2016.  The crewmembers are:
</span></p><ul><li><span>Flight Engineer 3 Robert S. Kimbrough, <span>NASA </span></span></li><li><span>Flight Engineer 4 Andrei Borisenko, <span>RSA </span></span></li><li><span>Flight Engineer 5 Sergey Ryzhikov, RSA </span></li></ul><p><span>The official start of Expedition 49 began when the 47/48 crew returned to Earth on September 7, 2016, and handed the command of the International Space Station (ISS) over to Commander Anatoli Ivansishin.  The expedition&nbsp; concluded in October when the Expedition 48/49 crew return to Earth.&nbsp; </span><br></p>
        </div>

